<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Monday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>				 3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.55 /11.45  11.85  /11.75   12.25 /12.15</p>
<p>BPI			 11.65 /11.45  11.95  /11.75   12.35 /12.15</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.50 /11.40  11.85  /11.75   12.25 /12.15</p>
<p>Multinational	   11.50 /11.25  11.85  /11.65   12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>PCIBank		   11.60 /11.45  12.10  /11.80   12.50 /12.20</p>
<p>PNB			 11.50 /11.40  11.825 /11.775  12.25 /12.15</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.55 /11.475 11.90  /11.825  12.30</p>
<p>/12.225</p>
<p>StandChart		11.575/11.425 11.85  /11.75</p>
<p>12.175/12.075</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
